<title>FRANCE: Four ships loading wheat in Rouen, one more due.</title>
<headline>Four ships loading wheat in Rouen, one more due.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four ships are loading a total of 55,000 tonnes of wheat at Rouen, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The flour was for export to Egypt, Italy and Madagascar, they said.</p>
<p>One more ship was expected in port very shortly to load 20,000 tonnes of wheat to an unspecified destination.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432 dom/bfl</p>
</text>
